(7307374, 1139857, 37858, '<td valign="top">When I look at this image I think "cold" - okay, I actually thought "freezing their __ off".  Obviously, they are huddling together for warmth, so I get that.  It''s just that with all that snow...well, you know.<br/> <br/>On the other hand, the technicals are all superb and the image is engaging.</td>', 'When I look at this image I think "cold" - okay, I actually thought "freezing their __ off".  Obviously, they are huddling together for warmth, so I get that.  It''s just that with all that snow...well, you know. On the other hand, the technicals are all superb and the image is engaging.', '2015-01-28 02:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
