(7308117, 1140084, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FromDaRock:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the cat in sleeping in the sun, but the whites are blown out and the view out the window takes away from the image.  I think even moving the basket left and using a shallow DOF might have greatly improved the image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Congratulations, obviously others don''t agree with my opinion ;-)</td>', 'Originally posted by FromDaRock: I like the cat in sleeping in the sun, but the whites are blown out and the view out the window takes away from the image.  I think even moving the basket left and using a shallow DOF might have greatly improved the image.   Congratulations, obviously others don''t agree with my opinion ;-)', '2015-01-30 07:55:24.000000', NULL, 0),
