(7308126, 1140057, 83149, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by illini75:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the scene and the processing but it doesn''t say warmth to me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I second that, how this scored high beats me, I must be just plain stupid! It is a nice scene though but not for this challenge! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Totally agree, it''s the opposite of warmth in every aspect.  Seems like an awfully high score for a clear DNMC.  That being said, it is still a nice image, but just doesn''t belong in the challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by illini75: I like the scene and the processing but it doesn''t say warmth to me.   I second that, how this scored high beats me, I must be just plain stupid! It is a nice scene though but not for this challenge!   Totally agree, it''s the opposite of warmth in every aspect.  Seems like an awfully high score for a clear DNMC.  That being said, it is still a nice image, but just doesn''t belong in the challenge.', '2015-01-30 08:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
