(7308131, 1140057, 7467, '<td valign="top">In Michigan, in the winter, you need to "improvise" to indicate warmth in an outdoor photo. To me, it is the warmth of bright sunshine, which is definitely warm.... :) <br/> <br/>"Description <br/> I''ve heard it''s warm in certain parts of the world. Let''s see if that''s true. If it''s not warm near you though, you''ll have to improvise."</td>', 'In Michigan, in the winter, you need to "improvise" to indicate warmth in an outdoor photo. To me, it is the warmth of bright sunshine, which is definitely warm.... :)  "Description  I''ve heard it''s warm in certain parts of the world. Let''s see if that''s true. If it''s not warm near you though, you''ll have to improvise."', '2015-01-30 08:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
