(7308159, 1140110, 121111, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, much appreciated ! <br/> <br/>Three singers who wanted some shots, they liked the expanse of empty terrain , at one point one suggested to get rid of most of the clothes,  the other two agreed, of course not without the strong objections of the photographer, and they just started doing things facing toward emptiness<br/> <br/>they kept their undies on (just for the nude police in dpc), three different colors and not very photogenic, I ask them to place the clothes to cover them (oops that may have upset the nude police), and got this shot<br/> <br/>my daugthers ? no ... I would need three different wifes, one big and tall, one skinny and quite beautiful, a third with green eyes and wonderful figure<br/> <br/>Sooc is warmer than this I played with analog efex pro and liked this effect, although it does make it cooler<br/> <br/>Arabian carpets ? just a few colorful rags brought by one of the girls<br/> <br/>The place is called Laguna seca de Sayula, near Guadalajara Mexico, dry during winter months , wet in the summer<br/> <br/>a couple more shots from the session<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//armando-m.smugmug.com/People/3-mosqueteras/i-M9djfZN/0/S/_DSC1018-S.jpg'', strrpos(''//armando-m.smugmug.com/People/3-mosqueteras/i-M9djfZN/0/S/_DSC1018-S.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//armando-m.smugmug.com/People/3-mosqueteras/i-M9djfZN/0/S/_DSC1018-S.jpg"/> <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//armando-m.smugmug.com/People/3-mosqueteras/i-JctPpRT/0/S/_DSC0953-S.jpg'', strrpos(''//armando-m.smugmug.com/People/3-mosqueteras/i-JctPpRT/0/S/_DSC0953-S.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//armando-m.smugmug.com/People/3-mosqueteras/i-JctPpRT/0/S/_DSC0953-S.jpg"/> <br/>quite a fun afternoon<br/>=8-)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, much appreciated !  Three singers who wanted some shots, they liked the expanse of empty terrain , at one point one suggested to get rid of most of the clothes,  the other two agreed, of course not without the strong objections of the photographer, and they just started doing things facing toward emptiness they kept their undies on (just for the nude police in dpc), three different colors and not very photogenic, I ask them to place the clothes to cover them (oops that may have upset the nude police), and got this shot my daugthers ? no ... I would need three different wifes, one big and tall, one skinny and quite beautiful, a third with green eyes and wonderful figure Sooc is warmer than this I played with analog efex pro and liked this effect, although it does make it cooler Arabian carpets ? just a few colorful rags brought by one of the girls The place is called Laguna seca de Sayula, near Guadalajara Mexico, dry during winter months , wet in the summer a couple more shots from the session   quite a fun afternoon=8-)', '2015-01-30 08:58:53.000000', NULL, 0),
